{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32177","headline":"酬友人 · 温庭筠","name":"酬友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辞荣亦素尚，倦游非夙心。\n宁复思金籍，独此卧烟林。\n闲云无定貌，佳树有余阴。\n坐久芰荷发，钓阑茭苇深。\n游鱼自摇漾，浴鸟故浮沈。\n唯君清露夕，一爲洒烦襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}